<title>USA: Midland forms exploration partnership.</title>
<headline>Midland forms exploration partnership.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midland Resources Inc said Wednesday it has formed Chalk Mountain Exploration Ltd, a partnership with a group of private investors.</p>
<p>Under the partnership agreement, investors will pay all seismic and land costs incurred by Midland Resources to develop the project and will also pay dry hole costs for the first exploration well.</p>
<p>Midland Resources said it will retain 50 percent of the working interests in the project. The exploration well is expected to be started by January 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
